# Package F "The '94 Harley": Ratchet has the key to the stash (old_harley_stash) that holds the an ignition module.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('old_harley_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Parts, labour, no questions. What do you need?
#
o_text: The Harley ignition is Dizzy's. He's old, and it's all he has.
o_id: old_harley_talk
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(old_harley)') && !HasItem('old_harley_stash_key')
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Easy')
o_succ: Yield
o_fail: Refuse
#
o_text: Make it worth my while and I tell Dizzy it's gone.
o_id: old_harley_bribe
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(old_harley)') && !HasItem('harley_ignition') && !HasFlag('old_harley_paid')
o_goto: Bribe
#
o_text: Business good?
o_id: old_harley_lore
o_goto: Lore
#
o_text: Bye.
o_id: old_harley_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: Lore
npc: Since the dome sealed, nothing new comes in. Everything is old parts on older machines. I'm not a thief, I'm an archaeologist.
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: old_harley_lore_back
o_goto: Default

name: Yield
npc: (He sighs.) Dizzy. Yeah. I didn't know it was his. Here, key to the bin. Tell him no hard feelings.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'old_harley_stash_key', 1)
effect: EndConversation

name: Refuse
npc: It's mine now. That's how parts work.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribe
npc: (He grins.) One-fifty. That module is going into a racer for a corporate kid. Pleasure doing business.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 150)
effect: SetFlag('old_harley_bribed')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: Need anything else stripped?
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Mind the oil.
effect: EndConversation
